# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Misc
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Environment files
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Log files
*.log
logs/

# Temporary files
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp

# Coverage reports
coverage/
*.lcov
tarpaulin-report.html

# Benchmark outputs
criterion/

# Profiling
*.profraw
*.profdata
perf.data
flamegraph.svg

# Auto Claude data directory
.auto-claude/

.compound-engineering/*.local.yaml
.worktrees

# Pi coding agent — keep config, ignore downloaded npm packages, sessions, and peer-review artefacts
.pi/npm/
.pi/sessions/
.pi/cache/
.pi/APPEND_SYSTEM.md
.pi/gentle-ai/
.peer-review/

# pi-lens LSP/AST cache directories — generated per-crate by the lens MCP server,
# never useful to share. Matches `.pi-lens/` at the workspace root and in every
# crate directory.
.pi-lens/

# Local Pi runtime state
.atl/

# Rust Code Studio planning artefacts (`.rust-studio/specs`, `.rust-studio/research`) are
# committed with the change they planned — AGENTS.md lists them among the archival roots.
# Raw dumps of upstream issue threads pulled in during triage are not: the triage ledger
# beside them records what each thread established.
.rust-studio/specs/**/flutter-issues/[0-9]*.md

# Serena MCP — keep the shared project config (`.serena/project.yml`), ignore the
# per-developer cache + local override. The cache/`project.local.yml` ignores live
# in `.serena/.gitignore` (committed); nothing more is needed at the repo root.
.tokensave

# Per-developer agent-runtime state: personal permission allowlists, which are
# machine state rather than something to grant every contributor by default.
.qwen/

# wasm-bindgen output of the web examples (wasm-pack or wasm-bindgen; see examples/README.md)
examples/*/pkg/

# mdBook build output (built by `mdbook build book/`, deployed by .github/workflows/docs.yml)
/book/book/

# Per-run agent checklist (AGENTS.md "Long runs"); lives in the worktree, never committed.
/TASKS.md
